<!--
		Start text, open play only: "Banan kommer startas klockan 16:00." or "Banan kommer strax
		startas." in the reception's language (PlayerNamesMessage.h in the code). Blank when the
		message carries none - a competition's names, an older reception - and an older Commercial,
		which does not know the id, leaves it blank too. Under the panel, one column per name count
		as the panel has: 15 below it and as tall as a name row, except with eight names, where the
		panel reaches 1030 and leaves 42 above the bottom. Between the two pin pictures (PinLeft ends
		at 491, PinsRight starts at 1430), centred on the screen, white with a dark edge so it reads
		on the background.
-->
			<true_type_text>
				<id>#START_TEXT#</id>
				<text></text>
				<font>Arial</font>
				<color_fill>
					<trans>255</trans>
					<red>255</red>
					<green>255</green>
					<blue>255</blue>
				</color_fill>
				<color_shadow>
